WEBVTT

00:00:00.687 --> 00:00:02.927
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I <b>have to</b> speak English at work.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.695
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> She <b>has to</b> get up at seven every day.

00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:11.993
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> We <b>don’t have to</b> wear a uniform at this school.

00:00:14.035 --> 00:00:16.190
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> He <b>doesn’t have to</b> work on Saturdays.

00:00:18.145 --> 00:00:19.945
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> <b>Do</b> I <b>have to</b> buy a grammar book?

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:24.186
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> What time <b>does</b> she <b>have to</b> get up in the morning?